    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dive into post-apocalyptic vibes. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Experience the cyber club vibe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Explore fantasy realms. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>Dive into a sci-fi universe. Wishlist Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>Join the CO-OP Frenzy in \u201cSHARK SIEGE - TOGETHER SURVIVAL\u201d!<br><br>Dive into a thrilling survival adventure in the vast, unpredictable ocean in \u201cSHARK SIEGE - TOGETHER SURVIVAL\u201d. Whether you\u2019re playing solo or teaming up with friends, you\u2019ll need to use your wits, teamwork, and resourcefulness to withstand the relentless attacks of a giant, menacing shark determined to breach the hull.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/f77f49b4458f473b6d1c2a3236d3365d.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/f77f49b4458f473b6d1c2a3236d3365d.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Dynamic Environment: Experience the terror and unpredictability of the ocean. Face environmental challenges like storms and navigate through perilous waters while keeping your ship afloat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survival at Sea: As part of a crew aboard a modern cargo ship, face off against a colossal shark intent on breaching your hull. Use teamwork and quick thinking to repair, craft weapons, and navigate storms, all while outsmarting the ocean's apex predator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Resource Management: Scavenge for materials aboard the ship to repair damages, craft weapons, and create defenses. Wise management of resources is crucial for your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immersive First-Person Gameplay: Feel the intensity of the situation with a first-person perspective that puts you right in the heart of the action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/22a9eeb2dbf295d03416f3db19d92898.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/22a9eeb2dbf295d03416f3db19d92898.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/22a9eeb2dbf295d03416f3db19d92898.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Menacing Marine Foe: Face off against a brilliantly AI-controlled shark, with behaviors and attack patterns that change, making each encounter unpredictable and challenging.<br><br>Solo or co-op, your survival depends on your ability to work together, adapt, and overcome the ultimate predator of the seas! Can you survive the Shark Siege?",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Join the CO-OP Frenzy in \u201cSHARK SIEGE - TOGETHER SURVIVAL\u201d!<br><br>Dive into a thrilling survival adventure in the vast, unpredictable ocean in \u201cSHARK SIEGE - TOGETHER SURVIVAL\u201d. Whether you\u2019re playing solo or teaming up with friends, you\u2019ll need to use your wits, teamwork, and resourcefulness to withstand the relentless attacks of a giant, menacing shark determined to breach the hull.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/f77f49b4458f473b6d1c2a3236d3365d.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/f77f49b4458f473b6d1c2a3236d3365d.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Dynamic Environment: Experience the terror and unpredictability of the ocean. Face environmental challenges like storms and navigate through perilous waters while keeping your ship afloat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/75bd47643a5c22dd6f505af1d0f01820.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Survival at Sea: As part of a crew aboard a modern cargo ship, face off against a colossal shark intent on breaching your hull. Use teamwork and quick thinking to repair, craft weapons, and navigate storms, all while outsmarting the ocean's apex predator.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/c2424721b07e8c6cd81794ffdecee9f3.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Resource Management: Scavenge for materials aboard the ship to repair damages, craft weapons, and create defenses. Wise management of resources is crucial for your survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.webm?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/3c2727c105bc6683bd0c2544514ee455.mp4?t=1732528996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immersive First-Person Gameplay: Feel the intensity of the situation with a first-person perspective that puts you right in the heart of the action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/22a9eeb2dbf295d03416f3db19d92898.poster.avif?t=1732528996\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2845080/extras/22a9eeb2dbf295d03416f3db19d9